    "body": "When encountering exceptions in VS Code we take measures remove any PII, esp. from stack traces. However, [Client#trackException](https://github.com/Microsoft/ApplicationInsights-node.js/blob/master/Library/Client.ts#L90) counters that effort by throwing new errors in case it doesn't understand the given one and thereby leaking stack traces that include PII.\n",
